Migrations for Daily Choice Zone.

The database URL comes from the application settings (see env.py), so these
commands need no arguments beyond the message:

    alembic revision --autogenerate -m "add something"
    alembic upgrade head
    alembic downgrade -1
    alembic current
    alembic history

The application applies `upgrade head` itself at startup when AUTO_MIGRATE is
on. It never downgrades and never drops: a startup routine that can delete a
table is one that eventually will.
